{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/extras/add_wishlist.gif?t=1751330666\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Arashi Gaiden, you must defeat ALL enemies, turn after turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/extras/02-vai-vem.gif?t=1751330666\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arashi Gaiden is a turn-based action game with fast-paced dash and slash combat. Use the dash mechanic to quickly traverse levels and slice your enemies in half in style, combining your blade with shurikens, teleports and chains that paralyze your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/extras/04-boss.gif?t=1751330666\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overcome levels with mechanics that change how you play and face Bosses that redefine what a turn-based game is by using special abilities in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/extras/05-dialogo-360p.gif?t=1751330666\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Key Features</u>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Over 5 hours of fun in turn-based combat, with diverse challenges and multiple solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Make quick combos or plan combat carefully, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A new level for an innovative combat system, Dash and Slash: enjoy turn-based combat with fast moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Fully handmade pixel art featuring themed settings from different locations in Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discover Arashi's story and his involvement with Lobo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/extras/06-lobo-360p.gif?t=1751330666\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Get Power-Ups as you progress through the game, but manage them well during the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/extras/03-skills.gif?t=1751330666\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a stylish turn-based action game with puzzle features (or vice versa).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/extras/01-freeze.gif?t=1751330666\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3040170?t=1751330666","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751330666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/b3eb701408a97595229f1116e597ffb5fc91cfa9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751330666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040170/b3eb701408a97595229f1116e597ffb5fc91cfa9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751330666","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3387590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_p